# armour/tiles/lames: plate lames over the plate sleeve and thigh regions (U F, T: the cuisses; greaves come with the boots dial): a step-1 line every third row, the
# arm's planes kept between them, so a vambrace or a cuisse reads as rigid overlapping plates (never a gradient).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h; `on-region` is P2C_CONTRACTS 4 (the regions after the word).
use person
body adult
role overlay lames
tags tile overlay
on-region U F T

view D key rest origin 0 0
|x
|x
|w

